{"id":"wb-8-497","name":"回銮碑","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"回銮碑","text":"回銮碑，亦称契丹出境碑，位于中国河南省濮阳市濮阳县御井街，是刻有宋真宗《契丹出境》诗的北宋石碑。碑于宋仁宗至和二年（1055年）奉诏刻立，诗文由宋真宗撰写并亲书。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9B%9E%E9%8A%AE%E7%A2%91","revisionId":95385007,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95385007","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":null}